<%- include('../partials/header', { pageTitle: 'About Us — VisionVogue Luxury Eyewear' }) %>

<div class="container-xl" style="padding-top:40px; padding-bottom:80px;">

  <!-- Hero Header -->
  <div class="text-center mb-5 reveal">
    <span class="badge bg-dark text-gold px-3 py-2 text-uppercase letter-spacing-1 mb-2" style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:2px; border: 1px solid #c9a35c;">Our Heritage & Craftsmanship</span>
    <h1 class="font-display display-4 text-dark fw-bold mt-2">Redefining Eyewear for the Modern Aesthetic</h1>
    <p class="text-muted mx-auto" style="max-width:720px; font-size:16.5px; line-height:1.7;">
      VisionVogue was founded with a singular ambition: to bridge high-fashion luxury aesthetics with uncompromising optical precision. Every frame in our collection is an ode to timeless geometry, premium materials, and modern innovation.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Specifications & Core Pillars -->
  <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm p-4 text-center" style="background:#fcfbfa; border-radius:16px;">
        <div class="icon-wrap mx-auto mb-3" style="width:64px; height:64px; background:var(--dark-grey); color:var(--gold); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:26px;">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-gem"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display h4 fw-bold">Italian Handcrafted Acetate</h3>
        <p class="text-muted small" style="line-height:1.6;">
          Carved from organic cotton-based cellulose acetate, polished for 72 hours in wooden barrels to yield an unmistakable, rich luster and skin-friendly hypoallergenic feel.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm p-4 text-center" style="background:#fcfbfa; border-radius:16px;">
        <div class="icon-wrap mx-auto mb-3" style="width:64px; height:64px; background:var(--dark-grey); color:var(--gold); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:26px;">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display h4 fw-bold">AI Virtual Scan & Try-On</h3>
        <p class="text-muted small" style="line-height:1.6;">
          Our proprietary facial topography mapping engine evaluates pupil distance, bridge contour, and cheekbone symmetry to suggest flawless frame proportions instantly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm p-4 text-center" style="background:#fcfbfa; border-radius:16px;">
        <div class="icon-wrap mx-auto mb-3" style="width:64px; height:64px; background:var(--dark-grey); color:var(--gold); border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:26px;">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-microscope"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display h4 fw-bold">German Precision Lenses</h3>
        <p class="text-muted small" style="line-height:1.6;">
          Custom digital surfacing, hydrophobic water-repellent coating, anti-glare anti-reflective treatment, and 100% UV400 / blue-light shielding built into every lens.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Detailed Specifications Table -->
  <div class="bg-white p-4 p-md-5 rounded-4 shadow-sm mb-5 border">
    <div class="row align-items-center">
      <div class="col-lg-6 mb-4 mb-lg-0">
        <span class="text-gold text-uppercase fw-semibold" style="letter-spacing:1.5px; font-size:12px;">Optical Excellence</span>
        <h2 class="font-display display-6 fw-bold mt-1 mb-3">Technical Specifications</h2>
        <p class="text-muted" style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.7;">
          At VisionVogue, precision isn't an after-thought — it is engineered directly into our manufacturing pipeline. We pair traditional Japanese wire-core temples with German OBE 5-barrel hinges to withstand thousands of flexes.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-unstyled text-dark mt-3" style="font-size:14.5px;">
          <li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold me-2"></i> <strong>Hinge Architecture:</strong> German OBE 5-barrel & flex spring hinges</li>
          <li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold me-2"></i> <strong>Material Standard:</strong> Mazzucchelli 1849 Acetate & Grade 5 Titanium</li>
          <li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold me-2"></i> <strong>Coatings Included:</strong> Anti-Reflective, Scratch Resistant, Oleophobic</li>
          <li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold me-2"></i> <strong>Quality Check:</strong> 18-stage individual manual inspection</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="p-3 bg-dark text-white rounded-3 shadow">
          <div class="d-flex justify-content-between border-bottom border-secondary pb-2 mb-3">
            <span class="text-gold fw-bold">Specification Benchmark</span>
            <span class="text-white-50">VisionVogue Standard</span>
          </div>
          <div class="d-flex justify-content-between py-2 border-bottom border-secondary" style="font-size:14px;">
            <span>Frame Weight Range</span>
            <span class="fw-semibold">14g – 22g (Ultra Lightweight)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="d-flex justify-content-between py-2 border-bottom border-secondary" style="font-size:14px;">
            <span>UV Radiation Blocking</span>
            <span class="fw-semibold">100% UV400 (200nm - 400nm)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="d-flex justify-content-between py-2 border-bottom border-secondary" style="font-size:14px;">
            <span>Lens Index Capability</span>
            <span class="fw-semibold">1.56, 1.61, 1.67 High Index & 1.74 Thin</span>
          </div>
          <div class="d-flex justify-content-between py-2 border-bottom border-secondary" style="font-size:14px;">
            <span>Blue Light Shield</span>
            <span class="fw-semibold">Cuts 98% harmful 420nm HEV Rays</span>
          </div>
          <div class="d-flex justify-content-between py-2" style="font-size:14px;">
            <span>Warranty</span>
            <span class="fw-semibold text-gold">1-Year Unconditional Coverage</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Leadership & Staff Team -->
  <div class="text-center mb-5">
    <span class="text-gold text-uppercase fw-semibold" style="letter-spacing:1.5px; font-size:12px;">Behind The Brand</span>
    <h2 class="font-display display-5 fw-bold mt-1">Our Leadership & Master Artisans</h2>
    <p class="text-muted mx-auto" style="max-width:600px;">Meet the optical engineers, designers, and visionaries leading VisionVogue.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="row g-4">
    <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm text-center p-3 h-100" style="border-radius:16px; background:#fff;">
        <div class="rounded-circle overflow-hidden mx-auto mb-3 shadow" style="width:130px; height:130px; border:3px solid var(--gold-soft);">
          <img src="/images/team/alexander.jpg" alt="Alexander Vance" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:top;">
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-display h5 fw-bold mb-1">Alexander Vance</h4>
        <span class="text-gold small text-uppercase fw-semibold mb-2 d-block" style="font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Founder & Chief Creative</span>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">15+ years in luxury optics design across Milan and Paris. Pioneered our signature frame silhouettes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm text-center p-3 h-100" style="border-radius:16px; background:#fff;">
        <div class="rounded-circle overflow-hidden mx-auto mb-3 shadow" style="width:130px; height:130px; border:3px solid var(--gold-soft);">
          <img src="/images/team/evelyn.jpg" alt="Dr. Evelyn Thorne" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:top;">
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-display h5 fw-bold mb-1">Dr. Evelyn Thorne</h4>
        <span class="text-gold small text-uppercase fw-semibold mb-2 d-block" style="font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Head of Optometry</span>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Doctor of Optometry with clinical research focus in progressive lens geometry and digital eye strain reduction.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm text-center p-3 h-100" style="border-radius:16px; background:#fff;">
        <div class="rounded-circle overflow-hidden mx-auto mb-3 shadow" style="width:130px; height:130px; border:3px solid var(--gold-soft);">
          <img src="/images/team/marcus.jpg" alt="Marcus Sterling" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:top;">
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-display h5 fw-bold mb-1">Marcus Sterling</h4>
        <span class="text-gold small text-uppercase fw-semibold mb-2 d-block" style="font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Master Frame Artisan</span>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">3rd-generation eyewear craftsman specializing in custom titanium forging and hand-beveled beveling.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm text-center p-3 h-100" style="border-radius:16px; background:#fff;">
        <div class="rounded-circle overflow-hidden mx-auto mb-3 shadow" style="width:130px; height:130px; border:3px solid var(--gold-soft);">
          <img src="/images/team/sophia.jpg" alt="Sophia Lin" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:top;">
        </div>
        <h4 class="font-display h5 fw-bold mb-1">Sophia Lin</h4>
        <span class="text-gold small text-uppercase fw-semibold mb-2 d-block" style="font-size:11.5px; letter-spacing:0.5px;">Director of Experience</span>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">Oversees Virtual Try-On user experience, Try @ Home logistics, and VIP client consultations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

